---
description: Frontend conventions for React components
globs: frontend/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

- Use functional components with hooks only (no class components)
- TypeScript strict mode — no `any` types
- Tailwind CSS for all styling — no CSS modules, no styled-components
- React Query for all data fetching — useQuery with refetchInterval for polling
- All API calls go to the FastAPI backend (relative URL /api/...)
- Profile flags persist in localStorage key "ember_profile_flags"
- Component files go in frontend/src/components/
- Admin components go in frontend/src/components/admin/
- Map component uses Mapbox GL JS with token from VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN env var
